rust	UNKNOWN STEP	## For humans
rust	UNKNOWN STEP	
rust	UNKNOWN STEP	The background drive pass that runs every minute does much less repeated work on a long history: it no longer
rust	UNKNOWN STEP	re-reads the whole event log for each issue, skips finished issues where they can't need anything, and parses the
rust	UNKNOWN STEP	cached list of open pull requests once per pass instead of once per issue. On a 30,000-event history with 200
rust	UNKNOWN STEP	issues a fast pass now uses about half the CPU it did. Nothing changes in what drive decides or does.
